{
  "description": "A47: GET /insights?period=week|month[&category=]. The window is the user's local week (Monday to Sunday) or calendar month containing their local today at request time (UserCalendar), never a client date. Consistency counts closed eligible periods only (A28: a period belongs to the window containing its start date); protected periods count in the denominator, never the numerator; open, future, not-due periods and archived habits are excluded. xp_earned is 10 per active XP entitlement (the net ledger, A40) dated from the window start through `through`, so not-due check-ins and days in a still-open weekly period count, today never does, and archived habits keep theirs. percent rounds half up and is null when nothing is eligible. by_category lists categories with eligible > 0 in DefinitionVersion::CATEGORIES order and sums to totals. Week only: days (habit-day counts of day periods; open is today; future days have null counts) and open_periods (weekly habits whose current period is open). Each case declares its seed: 'domain/insights.json' means that file's seed (the five daily/weekday habits); extra_habits and steps are added on top. Habit names never travel; the app resolves them locally.",
  "suites": [
    "php",
    "dart"
  ],
